@BioRed_HostAddress = https://localhost:7069
@AccessToken = PEGAR_ACCESS_TOKEN
@RefreshToken = PEGAR_REFRESH_TOKEN

### Comprobar Azure SQL
GET {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health/database
Accept: application/json

### Iniciar sesión
POST {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "admin@correo.com",
  "password": "ClaveSegura#2026"
}

### Renovar tokens
POST {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{RefreshToken}}"
}

### Perfil actual
GET {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Sucursales cercanas a Coatepeque
GET {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geolocation/branches/nearby?latitude=14.700255&longitude=-91.865110&maximumDistanceKm=25
Accept: application/json

### Crear acceso para un repartidor existente (requiere rol ADMIN)
POST {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "repartidor@correo.com",
  "userType": "Repartidor",
  "referenceId": "REP-001"
}

### Cambiar contraseña temporal (sin Bearer)
POST {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/change-temporary-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "repartidor@correo.com",
  "temporaryPassword": "PEGAR_CLAVE_RECIBIDA",
  "newPassword": "NuevaClaveSegura#2026"
}

### Reemitir contraseña temporal (requiere rol ADMIN)
POST {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/accounts/1/temporary-password
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Actualizar ubicación del repartidor
POST {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geolocation/drivers/location
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 14.700255,
  "longitude": -91.865110,
  "orderId": null
}

### Seguimiento de un pedido
GET {{BioRed_HostAddress}}/api/v1/geolocation/orders/1/tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
